      ],
      "en": "Better is the poor who walks in his integrity than he who is perverse in his lips and is a fool.",
      "ko": "성실히 행하는 가난한 자는 입술이 패려하고 미련한 자보다 나으니라",
      "source_text_hash": "dea3950a63ac7bd8e3c4d100320b745fd6c339e2eb2ecee0dcdbc83d33e1f50d",
      "translation_text_hash": "47dbbdcc9a817033b528b4b7aea3abe8437b86543163b3284cd55030c67027d4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "성실히 행하는 가난한 자는 입술이 패려하고 미련한 자보다 나으니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "47dbbdcc9a817033b528b4b7aea3abe8437b86543163b3284cd55030c67027d4"
      ]
    },
    {
