          "chapter": 19,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "It isn’t good to have zeal without knowledge, nor to be hasty with one’s feet and miss the way.",
      "ko": "지식 없는 소원은 선치 못하고 발이 급한 사람은 그릇하느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "6a6456c2691016931ff62015d8d6031f165592e56a077ef4e384a3545a239bda",
      "translation_text_hash": "55bb00523ee2117d95b53154d73067cda401c94cd9c486385a2e2e70b3a90391",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
