      "en": "All the relatives of the poor shun him; how much more do his friends avoid him! He pursues them with pleas, but they are gone.",
      "ko": "가난한 자는 그 형제들에게도 미움을 받거든 하물며 친구야 그를 멀리 아니하겠느냐 따라가며 말하려 할찌라도 그들이 없어졌으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "f3f248fd0a2eec8a9472bef261596f1e3f574f3e6edd473a7fc603cfe32ba908",
      "translation_text_hash": "8e104d8ef34c21b8b0cbd2259b84a35c5a0093e6915bc2b8f3eaf7c8c27b3353",
